# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   Reference: https://github.com/pyenv/pyenv/blob/master/COMMANDS.md#pyenv-version-file
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different models/versions of Python,
#   it may cause dependency resolution issues in locked Pipfile.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Shared lockfile is recommended: https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file-to-version-control
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   https://pdm.fury.tech/latest/usage/project/#pdm-lock
.pdm-python
pdm.lock

